<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 94,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 94,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said actual interior</p>
<p>Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts were :</p>
<p>Thursday: 94,000 head versus 95,000 estimate.</p>
<p>Friday:  Holiday.</p>
<p>Saturday: 7,000 head versus 5,000 estimate.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows</p>
<p>and Gilts steady with the midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.50 -58.50	   58.50 -59.50</p>
<p>few			57.00 -59.00	   58.00 -60.00</p>
<p>Sows:  under 500 lbs steady-$1 lower, over steady-$0.50 higher</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  41.00 -44.00	   41.00 -44.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -47.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   46.00 -48.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
